# Frontend configuration — copy to `.env`.
#
# Vite exposes only VITE_-prefixed variables, and everything here ends up
# readable by anyone who opens the site. Backend secrets go in
# `server/.env.example` → `server/.env`, never in this file.

# Relative on purpose. The dev proxy in vite.config.ts and the Vercel rewrite
# both serve the API from this same origin, which keeps the session cookie
# first-party whatever host the app is opened on.
#
# An absolute URL also works — `https://api.example.com/trpc` — but then the
# cookie is cross-site and needs COOKIE_SAMESITE=none on the API.
VITE_API_URL=/trpc
